| Release asset name | `RtkService.ts:279-290` `getReleaseAssetName()` | returns `null` (no asset mapping for win32) | e.g. `rtk-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz`, `rtk-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz`, `rtk-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz` |
| PATH separator for env merge | `ptyManager.ts:240` | `;` | `:` |
| Test-harness shell (runHookTest exec-diff) | `RtkService.ts:780-781` (`runShell`) | `cmd.exe` with `['/c', cmd]` | `sh` with `['-c', cmd]` |
| Windows-only env vars passed to spawned process | `ptyManager.ts:254-277` | Adds `USERNAME`, `APPDATA`, `LOCALAPPDATA`, `USERPROFILE`, `TEMP`, `TMP`, `SystemRoot`, `SYSTEMROOT`, `SystemDrive`, `WINDIR`, `COMSPEC`, `PATHEXT`, `COMPUTERNAME`, `USERDOMAIN`, `ProgramFiles` | Adds `TERM=xterm-256color`, `COLORTERM=truecolor`, `USER` instead |
